    <title>ORS Consulting (ORS) | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="ORS Consulting (ORS) | 5 117 følgere på LinkedIn. ORS is a specialist provider of industrial risk management and process engineering advisory services. | ORS Consulting was established in 2009 with an aim to provide to-the-point consultancy services. The company built its reputation as risk and safety consultants for the offshore oil and gas industry, which is exposed to major accident risks due to the harsh environment, aging installations and expanding subsea and deep-water operations. 

Today, ORS Consulting provides technical risk management and process engineering advisory services supporting multiple industries, including green energy transition industries, chemicals, oil and gas, power and utilities, aquaculture and maritime.">

    <meta property="og:title" content="ORS Consulting (ORS) | LinkedIn">
    <meta property="og:description" content="ORS Consulting (ORS) | 5 117 følgere på LinkedIn. ORS is a specialist provider of industrial risk management and process engineering advisory services. | ORS Consulting was established in 2009 with an aim to provide to-the-point consultancy services. The company built its reputation as risk and safety consultants for the offshore oil and gas industry, which is exposed to major accident risks due to the harsh environment, aging installations and expanding subsea and deep-water operations. 

Today, ORS Consulting provides technical risk management and process engineering advisory services supporting multiple industries, including green energy transition industries, chemicals, oil and gas, power and utilities, aquaculture and maritime.">
