<!---->
          <h2 class="core-section-container__title section-title">
            Om oss
          </h2>

<!---->
      <div class="core-section-container__content break-words">
        

          <p class="break-words text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us__description">
              ORS Consulting was established in 2009 with an aim to provide to-the-point consultancy services. The company built its reputation as risk and safety consultants for the offshore oil and gas industry, which is exposed to major accident risks due to the harsh environment, aging installations and expanding subsea and deep-water operations. 

Today, ORS Consulting provides technical risk management and process engineering advisory services supporting multiple industries, including green energy transition industries, chemicals, oil and gas, power and utilities, aquaculture and maritime. ORS is an employee-owned company with offices and businesses in Sweden, Norway, Denmark, Türkiye and the United Kingdom. 
 
The corner stone of our business strategy is to focus on "to-the-point" and meaningful advisory. Our clients appreciate the way ORS combines the specialist skills with a pragmatic- and cooperative approach.
          </p>

