  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Next week, the ORS Consulting team will be at the Sustainable Aviation Futures (SAF) Congress Garden Party in London, and we're excited to be sponsoring the event.

The SAF industry continues to gain momentum, with ambitious projects being developed across the UK and internationally. We are proud to support organisations in delivering these projects safely through our expertise in industrial risk management.

Meet our colleagues <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/neill-renton-04b7811?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Neill Renton</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/samuel-richardson-a3404947?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Samuel Richardson</a> and <a class="link" href="https://no.linkedin.com/in/morten-nilstad-pettersen-42476212?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Morten Nilstad Pettersen</a> on the 10th of September. We look forward to catching up with existing contacts, making new connections and learning more about the exciting developments taking place across the SAF landscape.

The event is now fully booked but the wait list is open. If you'll be there, feel free to reach out and say hello.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsaf&amp;_l=no&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SAF</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsustainableaviationfutures&amp;_l=no&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SustainableAviationFutures</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fenergytransition&amp;_l=no&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#EnergyTransition</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fprocesssafety&amp;_l=no&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ProcessSafety</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Findustrialrisk&amp;_l=no&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#IndustrialRisk</a></p>
