    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="feed-reshare-content__commentary">🔦 OEUK Member of the Day: ORS Consulting (UK) Limited

Established in 2009, ORS Consulting built its name as a risk and safety adviser to the offshore oil and gas industry. Today they provide technical risk management and process engineering advice across a range of high-hazard industries.

Find out more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eWseArji?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eWseArji</a>

We're proud to have ORS Consulting (UK) Limited as part of the OEUK membership, along with our other 450+ members working across the UK's offshore energy sector.

👉 Interested in joining OEUK? Find out more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eBN9A6FU?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eBN9A6FU</a>

