  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Bridging academia and industry - Last Friday our colleague <a class="link" href="https://no.linkedin.com/in/per-st%C3%A5le-larsen-34600943?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Per Ståle Larsen</a> gave a guest lecture at NTNU in Trondheim.

The lecture provided the students with insights on how risk analysis methods are used in the industry and why understanding the context is key. In addition, real life examples of risk analysis application were presented.

Thank you <a class="link" href="https://no.linkedin.com/in/nicola-paltrinieri-31372a11?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nicola Paltrinieri</a> for organising the lecture and to all students who attended!</p>
